opentele2-browser
Copyright the opentele2 contributors

This crate is a Rust port of browserforge
(https://github.com/daijro/browserforge), Copyright daijro, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The Bayesian network sampler in src/network.rs
follows browserforge's bayesian_network.py.

The data/ directory embeds the Apify fingerprint datapoints from the Python
package apify_fingerprint_datapoints 0.15.0, part of Apify fingerprint-suite
(https://github.com/apify/fingerprint-suite), Copyright Apify Technologies
s.r.o., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its licence text is in
data/LICENSE-APIFY.md and its provenance in data/SOURCE.md.
